          <attvalue for="32" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened energy supply risk raises political urgency among consumer states, prompting governments to intensify diplomatic, regulatory and sanctioning efforts aimed at commercial communications firms (to limit escalation vectors or deny revenue flows), thereby increasing the intensity of state pressure on providers relevant to the Russia–Ukraine war." />
