          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A global finance shock that raises sovereign fiscal pressure in Iran (or its patrons) forces budget cuts and delays in external subsidy/arms transfers, directly reducing the funding, logistics and munitions available to proxy groups and thus lowering their operational tempo." />
