          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher real output growth reduces unemployment and income loss; conversely, a marked downturn (falling growth) quickly increases joblessness and grievance-driven demonstrations, so increases in growth lower protest frequency." />
