          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising investor risk aversion reduces willingness to finance exposure to sanction‑ or conflict‑exposed operations, prompting providers to rely on internal commercial risk assessments and exercise unilateral discretion to limit or withdraw services, increasing their de facto decision autonomy." />
