          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater propensity for unrest to spread across borders incentivizes governments to ramp up directed economic and regulatory interventions (subsidies, procurement rules, licensing limits) to harden the domestic tech sector against external shocks, raising state policy intensity." />
